1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:09,160
In this short tutorial, you schedule a report so that it reaches your team every Monday morning, without anyone opening Beacon Reports.

2
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:15,210
Open the report you want to send. In the top-right corner, select Schedule.

3
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:20,050
Under Recipients, type each email address and press Enter.

4
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:22,250
The address appears as a chip.

5
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:25,100
Recipients don't need a Beacon account.

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,900
Choose how often the report is sent, the day, and the time.

7
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,740
The time is shown in your own time zone.

8
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:39,370
Choose the format: PDF for a report people read, Spreadsheet for one they work with.

9
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:44,390
Then select Preview to see the subject line and the attachment's name.

10
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:47,220
Select Save schedule.

11
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:52,020
A message confirms the schedule and names the next delivery.

12
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:56,090
The Schedules tab lists it, with Edit and Pause beside it.

13
00:00:56,090 --> 00:00:56,930
You're done.
